  <item>
    <title>九段琦谈-我们眼中的2026 SIAS深圳耳机展有哪些有意思的产品？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a80a1c936641f136d88c4e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a80a1c936641f136d88c4e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 17:48:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026的SIAS深圳耳机展再次在深圳福田会展中心举办，我们几个主要的嘉宾也再次都来到了展会，不论是作为参展商还是媒体，在第一天结束后也又聚在晚上吃饭的包间一起录了这期线下节目，来分享一下我们在本次展会中遇到的感觉比较有趣的产品。</span></p><p><span>太久不录节目确实业务生疏了，全程没介绍都有谁……不过熟悉的朋友们肯定听出来了，本期节目的嘉宾有九段、黄老师、雪原、老王和郑老师以及徐冉。</span></p><p><span>本次展会的新品和有趣产品依然不少，并且隔壁就是同期在举办的深圳hyrox……健身人群和死肥宅在相近的两个展馆，这种反差可太逗了……</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">1:24</a> 关于展会的各种新品发布</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 七彩虹新耳塞：月球漫步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 乐图新大尾巴PAW S3</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> dita 新次旗舰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> es labs的假大奥es-he90</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> 拜亚dt275pro</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 海贝新品耳机与播放器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> aune耳放与AR9000</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> woo audio耳放</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3476">57:56</a> sony新耳塞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">61:50</a> allnic 7500耳放</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3919">65:19</a> 和声力 新品耳机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4008">66:48</a> Evoaria的新cd机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">68:39</a> nf audio</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4245">70:45</a> 艾达声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4503">75:03</a> 雪原笑吐了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5018">83:38</a> 拓品 声卡键盘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5295">88:15</a> ak pd5播放器 sp4000t</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/5f0e5de46d76607427dc3f19/lpPQB5GuDA3CVvbe8EzDrir-c2jD.m4a" length="92669221" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvni_eLFnPwOIMvdDMojoS6Efyiz.jpg"/>
