  <item>
    <title>九段琦谈-分享我们最近听过的好专辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69db6f26e2c8be3155ffbbd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69db6f26e2c8be3155ffbbd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前几天雪原在我们的群里感慨“最近好听的专辑好多”，所以就有了这期节目，拉上刘律和桃子我们一起聊聊最近一个季度我们听到了哪些有意思和让我们惊喜的专辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目推荐的专辑大部分都是新专辑，也有少量发布了有一段时间的专辑，依然包含各种风格的音乐。老规矩封面我们都放在下方了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你最近听了什么有意思的新专辑非常喜欢，也欢迎在评论区给我们留言分享给我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期推荐的唱片封面：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqVIvORBzOFY3L1DoQLfDyA9jSGE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvsufiiJJM-fNIZ3I7RBtIddPnz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp84N8yGkUQ2GmwaSD4UPEGOoME5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxTtQk9TYkBC2c77YPs3iu6S5YB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmoG41Yz8ssNJkHh5zvRgcom4fmE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ForJu6ScKNs5C9q7qwG_u_hXqnQP.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhzMAr-4cfdFiC4GqBAY7G8UZQR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm71mUAhz20He8YeCAQWZiLFcPJY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZmc6SaOY0Z_gXqjWt_sueh0i6u.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkm15wP8FavU92uk9vrgEO90ofDH.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fga70cTxGjVltA3f1leGzykTOIcF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2Wt3pCqryaS9cEnHS9z_qqF1e0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhwCD3I6XUvpqKSPQGuA3F3e-hXY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnebLvN-BpuA1gRAam-vVFCeqdp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
