    <guid isPermaLink="false">693d8f3e37f52a644ec50060</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Dec 2025 16:20:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又到展会节目啦，很久没更新了实在抱歉毕竟沉迷吃鸡。但逛展会打不了游戏了所以只能继续录节目了/狗头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是2025年广州耳机展的线下录音，本期节目的嘉宾还是我们耳机展线下录音的常规阵容。本期节目的嘉宾有黄老师、老王、郑老师、雪原、桃子和九段老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>广州耳机展是每年耳机展会的收官也是每年品牌最多规模最大的耳机展会，今年的广州展还是出现了不少我们觉得有趣甚至想买的产品，第一天结束我们就来分享一下今天看到的有趣的产品吧，不过第一天人也多，也出现了一些我们实在排不上队的产品，今后有机会再跟大家分享。但总之周日还有一天，可以一边收听节目一边逛展！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 钰龙DA2展台上的森海塞尔 540G</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> HEDD D1动圈耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a>: STAX 009D</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> MEZE 紫凤凰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 拜雅 DT270PRO</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> EvoAria 新品播放器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> Final DX6000 &amp; DX3000CL</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a> Dita Ventura</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2777">46:17</a> 歌德 S750 &amp; S950</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3029">50:29</a> 飞傲 雪漫天新品：DISC &amp; EH11</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3393">56:33</a> iBasso D16 TAIPAN关于大尾巴的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3724">62:04</a> 达音科 熏·Kaoru &amp; 泠·LYNN &amp; CONCEPT T</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4004">66:44</a> 水月雨 Old Fashion</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4223">70:23</a> RAAL 1995 Immanis</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4393">73:13</a> Softears RS10II</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4553">75:53</a> qdc Crave</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4879">81:19</a> 海贝 星海贝 AP10音频隔离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4988">83:08</a> 关于展会的感受（扯淡环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5456">90:56</a> YBA 便携SACD</span></p>]]></description>
